So batch-a (likely m5) would fail a missing-KMS-key check, while hpo-b (likely g4dn) could be exempt as hardware-encrypted — but I should caveat this since I'm inferring the IDs rather than confirming them, and should verify against AWS's official instance-store list before stating this definitively.

